---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/privacy.css';
---

<BaseLayout title="Events Privacy Policy" description="Bay Area Events Monitor privacy policy. No personal data collected.">
  <main class="privacy-page grid-page">
    <a href="/events/" class="back-link">&larr; Events</a>

    <header class="privacy-header">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="privacy-updated">Last updated: March 13, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>What This Page Does</h2>
      <p>The Bay Area Events Monitor displays newly discovered tech and AI events from Luma and Eventbrite. It runs entirely in your browser.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Data Collection</h2>
      <p>This page does <strong>not</strong> collect or store any personal data beyond standard analytics. Specifically:</p>
      <ul class="privacy-list">
        <li>No data sent to external servers (except fetching event data)</li>
        <li>No cookies set by this page</li>
        <li>No user accounts or sign-in</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This website uses Google Analytics via Google Tag Manager to understand page visits and interactions. Google's <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="privacy-link">privacy policy</a> applies to that data. However, <strong>NO PERSONAL IDENTIFIERS</strong> are collected. The analytics data is fully anonymous and is only used to improve the experience, such as underused features may be removed, and popular ones refined, etc.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Event Data</h2>
      <p>Event listings are fetched from a public source and displayed directly in your browser. No personal data is included in these requests.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Local Storage</h2>
      <p>Your language preference is saved using the browser's local storage. This data stays on your device and is never transmitted anywhere.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Feedback Form</h2>
      <p>If you submit feedback, it is sent to Formspree. Only the message content is transmitted. No personal identifiers are attached.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted here.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Reach out at <a href="/events/" class="privacy-link">kunli.co/events</a>.</p>
    </section>

  </main>
</BaseLayout>
